Список `kept` пустой; цикл `for box, conf in sorted(dets, key=lambda d: -d[1])`. Условие «оставить» — `all(iou(box, k_box) <= thr for k_box, _ in kept)` (для пустого `kept` `all` вернёт `True`).

```python
def nms(dets, thr=0.5):
    kept = []
    for box, conf in sorted(dets, key=lambda d: -d[1]):
        if all(iou(box, kb) <= thr for kb, _ in kept):
            kept.append((box, conf))
    return kept
```
